==Battleground==
*6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**12 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 8.33~11.67 seconds<sup>250f~350f</sup>.
**8 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**18 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
**5 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
**24 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's main threat is the horde of Zuches that spawn upon base hit. The other peons can be disposed of quite easily, so only a countermeasure for the Zuches is necessary.

===Recommended Units===
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]: A cheap and disposable unit that can reliably kill the Zuches, but may be difficult to obtain prior to this stage.
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]: Due to the low magnifications of the Zuches, Shigong is capable of both stalling and killing them effectively.
*Talented [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]]: If you lack Cadaver BearCat, Cataur is a good alternative. Be careful when using him, as he is frail and can drain your cash rather quickly.
*[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]: Not really a Zuche counter, but he can rush THE SLOTH and destroy the base before the Zombie peons become an issue.

